State 0

    0 $accept: • axioma $end

    IDENTIF  shift, and go to state 1
    INTEGER  shift, and go to state 2
    MAIN     shift, and go to state 3

    axioma              go to state 4
    programa_principal  go to state 5
    variables           go to state 6
    variable            go to state 7
    funciones           go to state 8
    funcion             go to state 9
    main                go to state 10


State 1

   11 funcion: IDENTIF • $@1 '(' parametros ')' '{' sentencias '}'

    $default  reduce using rule 10 ($@1)

    $@1  go to state 11


State 2

    6 variable: INTEGER • definicion ';'
    7         | INTEGER • definicion ',' definiciones ';'

    IDENTIF  shift, and go to state 12

